1:["$","main",null,{"className":"reading-page post-reading-page","children":["$","article",null,{"className":"post-article h-entry","children":[["$","$L7",null,{"className":"u-url sr-only","href":"/blog/fosa/fosa-ch10","children":["FOSA丨10丨分层架构"," 永久链接"]}],["$","a",null,{"className":"p-author h-card sr-only","href":"https://github.com/hedon954","rel":"author","children":"Hedon"}],"$undefined",["$","header",null,{"className":"article-header article-summary-row","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"eyebrow","children":"架构设计"}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"p-name","children":"FOSA丨10丨分层架构"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"article-deck p-summary","children":"本篇通过回答《Fundamentals of Software Architecture》第十章的课后思考题，深入探讨分层架构中开放层与封闭层的核心差异、隔离层概念的重要价值、架构漏斗反模式的识别与防范，以及分层架构风格的主要驱动特性与局限性分析，帮助理解分层架构的设计原则和适用场景，提升架构师在选择和实施分层架构时的决策能力和风险评估意识。"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-meta","children":[["$","time",null,{"className":"dt-published","dateTime":"2025-07-14T10:20:00.000Z","children":["发布于 ","2025/07/14"]}],"$undefined",["$","span",null,{"children":"$undefined"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["约 ","1,753"," 字"]}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-reading-layout","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"article-reading-column","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"e-content","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"markdown-body","children":[["$","p","p-0",{"children":["本系列文章通过逐章回答",["$","a","a-0",{"href":"https://fundamentalsofsoftwarearchitecture.com/","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"https://fundamentalsofsoftwarearchitecture.com/"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"《Fundamentals of Software Architecture》","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":13,"offset":12},"end":{"line":1,"column":52,"offset":51}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":12,"offset":11},"end":{"line":1,"column":102,"offset":101}}},"target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","children":"《Fundamentals of Software Architecture》"}],"（下文简称 FOSA）一书中的课后思考题，来深入理解书中的核心概念和理论，从而提升我们的软件架构设计能力。本篇为",["$","u","u-0",{"children":"第十章"}],"内容。"]}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"本章的课后题是："}],"\n",["$","ol","ol-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"What is the difference between an open layer and a closed layer?"}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"开放层和封闭层有何区别？"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"Describe the layers of isolation concept and what the benefits are of this concept."}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"隔离层概念及其益处是什么？"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"What is the architecture sinkhole anti-pattern?"}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"架构漏斗反模式是什么？"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-3",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"What are some of the main architecture characteristics that would drive you to use a layered architecture?"}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"驱动采用分层架构风格的主要架构特性有哪些？"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-4",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"Why isn’t testability well supported in the layered architecture style?"}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"分层架构风格的可测试性为何不佳？"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-5",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"Why isn’t agility well supported in the layered architecture style?"}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"分层架构风格的敏捷性为何不佳？"}],"\n"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","hr","hr-0",{}],"\n",["$","h2","h2-0",{"id":"概念","children":["$","a","a-0",{"href":"#概念","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"#概念"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"概念","position":{"start":{"line":31,"column":4,"offset":776},"end":{"line":31,"column":6,"offset":778}}}]},"children":"概念"}]}],"\n",["$","p","p-2",{"children":["$","$L8","img-0",{"src":"https://hedonspace.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/img/image-20250714113807168.png","alt":"FOSA Figure 10-2. Physical topology (deployment) variants","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"img","properties":{"src":"https://hedonspace.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/img/image-20250714113807168.png","alt":"FOSA Figure 10-2. Physical topology (deployment) variants"},"children":[],"position":{"start":{"line":33,"column":1,"offset":780},"end":{"line":33,"column":141,"offset":920}}}}]}],"\n",["$","p","p-3",{"children":["分层架构的",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"核心驱动力"}],"是",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"关注点分离（Separation of Concerns）"}],"。它将一个复杂的系统按照不同的职责或技术关注点，垂直地划分成若干个水平的“层（Layer）”。"]}],"\n",["$","p","p-4",{"children":"每一层都有明确的职责："}],"\n",["$","ul","ul-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":["$L9","：负责处理用户界面和交互，例如 Web 页面或 API 端点。"]}],"\n","$La","\n","$Lb","\n","$Lc","\n"]}],"\n","$Ld","\n","$Le","\n","$Lf","\n","$L10","\n","$L11","\n","$L12","\n","$L13","\n","$L14","\n","$L15","\n","$L16","\n","$L17","\n","$L18","\n","$L19","\n","$L1a","\n","$L1b","\n","$L1c","\n","$L1d","\n","$L1e","\n","$L1f","\n","$L20"]}]}],"$L21","$L22","$L23"]}],"$L24"]}]]}]}]
